TITLE=Yomonsni - Development - Pairing
BGIMAGE=yo-IMG_57020-5DII-raw32-rawtherapee-shaped-flattened.jpg
SUBHEAD=Pairing for development

      <div class="col-10">
	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Why pairing</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">As it takes a bit of time to really open up and reveal yourself to someone, as well as to begin to trust their advice, Yomonsni development works with the idea of a long term pairing. The dynamic between <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a> and <a href="../about/glossary.html#jassia">Jassia</a>(you) is something of cross between coach/athlete, professor/grad student, mentor/mentee and catalyst for development. All told, the dynamic becomes very close, with foundations in radical openness, honesty, trust, acceptance and shared discovery..</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Yomonsni aims for the development of all Jassia to have this long term dynamic with a single Siazul. Each of us is capable of listening and trusting deeper the more we have spent time with and liked and respected someone. As growth and development are the objective, everything we can do to facilitate it is used unabashedly. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">That's not to say that you will never change to another Siazul, as your development and journey in life may take you places, physically and mentally, where you would be better served with another Siazul. The aim though is for minimal movement and maximal stability for each phase of your progress.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">It is worth noting that everyone participating in Yomonsni, is always a Jassia to another Siazul. This dynamic is something that everyone participates in as a Jassia every step of life within Yomonsni. Fundamentally, everyone is still developing, becoming, and benefits from having a Siazul to help them. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Matching</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">All effort is made to ensure that each Jassia is well matched to their Siazul, in temperment, outlook and interests to better facilitate and catalyze growth an development. At this very early stage of Yomonsni, this is achieved through careful selection of clients as there is not much variety in Siazul. As Yomonsni grows, this will be achieved through more objective psychological evaluation and matching. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>




	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">What is the dynamic</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">When we look at the dynamic between Jassia and Siazul, there are many things that should be present:</p>
	    <ul>
	    <li>Comfort and safety - each Jassia should feel completely safe and comfortable with their Siazul</li>
	    <li>Complete acceptance - there is no judgement in either direction, and a total embrace of who each other is</li>
	    <li>Cooperative - all of the work in Yomonsni is done with full cooperation between Jassia and Siazul</li>
	    <li>Educational - both Jassia and Siazul bring all of their knowledge and life experience into they dynamic, and together they learn and build and discover the path for the Jassia's development</li>
	    <li>Willing vulnerability - the Jassia opens themselves completely, holding nothing back</li>
	    <li>Nurturing - the Siazul encourages and fosters the development and learning of each Jassia they work with</li>
	    <li>Respectful - as both are working together, for the same goals, Jassia and Siazul respect each others time and their views and beliefs, without the needs to change or adopt them. </li>
	    <li></li>
	    <li></li>
	    </ul>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	
	
	
       


	
	
	
       
